the district attorney.

00:31:09.067 --> 00:31:10.735 align:start size:88% position:13%
She's probably a
Democrat, I don't know,

00:31:10.735 --> 00:31:13.438
it's a nonpartisan race, but
whatever, I voted for her,

00:31:13.438 --> 00:31:15.306
because, you know,
she was the person

00:31:15.306 --> 00:31:18.710
who was most likely to
succeed, and I live here.

00:31:18.710 --> 00:31:21.079
And so it matters to
me, it's, you know,

00:31:21.079 --> 00:31:22.347
I have to call the
police sometimes

00:31:22.347 --> 00:31:23.615
